.th DF 1M 
.sh NAME
df \- disk free
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd df
[ filesystem ] ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it df
prints out the number of total blocks, used blocks, free blocks, percentage of
used blocks and mount directory on the
.it filesystems.
If no file system is specified, the space on all of
the attached file systems is printed.
.sh FILES
Default file systems vary with installation.
